{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"follows","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"actor","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV","text":"Actor","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Actor"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"daemonName","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rooms","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8LocationV","text":"Location","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Location"},{"text":"]? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"while","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"gate","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"@escaping ","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"@Sendable","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" () -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = { true }, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"arrivals","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"] = []) -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV","text":"TimedEvent","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TimedEvent"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"actor","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The companion NPC.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"daemonName","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The daemon’s global timer name."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"rooms","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The destinations he will walk into; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" for anywhere.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"gate","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Extra gate checked first — a false gate is a quiet turn.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"arrivals","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Lines printed when the companion catches up, if lit —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cycled by the turn counter; empty for a silent companion."}]}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The following daemon, for the host’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"timers","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" block.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"rooms:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"while:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are the two ways to scope a follower, and they","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"scope different things. ","type":"text"},{"code":"rooms:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is a whitelist of ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"destinations","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" — a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"gaoler who walks the corridors and will not set foot in a cell follows","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"you along the one and lets you go into the other, which is what makes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“somewhere he will not go” a place you can stand. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"while:"},{"type":"text","text":" is an extra"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"gate evaluated first, exactly as "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/roams(_:daemonName:rooms:chancePerTurn:while:arrival:departure:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is, for the companion who has been told to wait. Either left out is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"always open, so a caller that passes neither behaves exactly as before."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A daemon that keeps ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"actor"},{"text":" in the player’s room: each turn, if the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"actor is onstage but elsewhere, it teleports to wherever the player","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"now stands. Daemons tick at the end of the turn, after the player’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"go"},{"text":" has resolved and the new room is described, so the companion","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"catches up the same turn and its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"arrival"},{"text":" line trails the room","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"description. The line prints only when the destination is lit: in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the dark the companion arrives unseen. There is deliberately no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"departure"},{"text":" line — the companion only ever moves ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"to","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" the player,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so no one is ever in the room it leaves to watch it go (unlike","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"roams"},{"text":"). The daemon idles while the actor is offstage — including","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vanish()"},{"text":" — and the host may ","type":"text"},{"code":"stopDaemon(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to park the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"companion for a “wait here” beat, then "},{"code":"startDaemon(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to resume."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It draws no randomness at all (unlike "},{"code":"roams","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"steals","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"following companion never perturbs the seeded stream: "},{"code":"arrivals","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cycled by the saved turn counter, so the line varies from arrival to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arrival yet stays deterministic across save and restore. Pass one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"line for a fixed announcement, a dozen so a constant companion does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not wear his welcome out. Start the companion co-located with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"player ("},{"code":"starts(in:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" the player’s start room) to avoid a spurious"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arrival on turn one."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors","doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/follows(_:daemonName:rooms:while:arrivals:)"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/follows(_:daemonname:rooms:while:arrivals:)"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:12GnustoActors14ActorBehaviorsV7follows_10daemonName5rooms5whil